00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:28,820
The conservation of mass, the Navier-Stokes equations for fluid dynamics, the laws of thermodynamics, they all govern how density, flow, and entropy interact.

138
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:36,060
By forcing the data into the RSVP structure, Yarncrawler can run those physics equations on the real-world data.

139
