Well, consider what sound actually is.

194
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:36,780
It's the propagation of mechanical energy through a medium, usually air or water, generated by friction, kinetic impact, or the rapid release of energy.

195
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:37,260
Right.

196
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:50,200
The paper points out that massive portions of the physical world are entirely hidden from cameras or LIDAR, but those hidden processes are highly audible as entropy production events.

197
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,140
Oh, I see.

